<title>USA: GTECH California lottery contract extended.</title>
<headline>GTECH California lottery contract extended.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWICH, R.I. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH said Monday that the California State Lottery Commission has voted to extend its contract with the company for five more years, until October 2003.</p>
<p>GTECH provides equipment and services for the lottery's on-line and instant ticket games. The company provided no further information on its contract extension.</p>
<p>GTECH currentlyb has contracts to supply and/or operate lottery systems for 29 U.S. customers and 49 customers outside the United States.</p>
</text>
